window.products.push({"id":617046,"name":"Stainless Steel 16 oz (Set of 2) Vacuum Insulated Coffee Mug with Handle and Lid, Large Thermal Camping Coffee Mugs with Sliding Lid for Men & Women, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jEbLjnWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-year Warranty & 100% Satisfaction – We know we’ve developed the best thermal coffee mug with handle, so we have no problem giving you a 5-year warranty & 100% satisfaction guaranteed. Thus you get to enjoy this perfect insulated tea mug in your favorite color, drinking a big cup of your favorite drink at your favorite temperature at home, work, or out in nature. In the event of any issues with the cups whatsoever, simply contact our friendly customer support team and we’ll make it right. CHILLOUT LIFE brings you the answer in our highest quality & durable, double walled, fully insulated 16 oz. camping coffee mug with lid. Available to you in singles or pairs in a variety of color options. This cool looking large stainless coffee cup is the perfect way to keep you hydrated on the hottest or the coldest days and it’s the best coffee mug to keep coffee hot. Super comfy to drink from & stays hot or cold for hours. The Ultimate Drinking Experience - This double walled metal coffee cup with handle is vacuum insulated with a premium copper lining. It maintains the temperature of your drink for much longer. This insulated camping mug with handle won’t sweat so that your hands never get overly hot or cold, nor will the cup slip. You’ll never see another cup ring on your furniture. Covered with a super durable, straw-friendly, splash proof, tritan sliding lid. With removable slider for easy cleaning. Always With You - The CHILLOUT LIFE thermal coffee mug with handle is made of premium 18/8 food grade stainless steel for a 100% durable unbreakable coffee mug. Electro polished on the inside, the cups stay 100% rust free. The outside of each mug is treated with powder coating finish preventing scratching, peeling or fading. It also has a great feel & looks incredibly chic. Easy clean - it’s wonderfully convenient to use at home or on the go instead of ceramic or enamel mugs. A Stunning Eco-friendly Stainless Steel Insulated Coffee Mug Gift - It comes in a gift box for singles or couples. Drinking from these stainless coffee mug with handle and lid reduces the use of plastic / paper cups both saving your pocket & the environment. Odorless & tasteless these insulated tea mug are the perfect alternative to non-recyclable materials. Buy yours now and make your favorite drink in your stainless steel mug with a lid before you leave home & save on expensive coffee shops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jEbLjnWvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHILLOUT LIFE","source_asin":"B0849X7K2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0849X7K2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0849X7K2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
