window.products.push({"id":617269,"name":"Redroad 10 in 1 Cordless Vacuum Cleaner & LED Screen 26.5Kpa Powerful Stick Vacuum, Double HEPA Filters & Roller Brush, Up to 60 Mins, Ultra Quiet Wir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G7bG88gmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌀 3 Suction Modes with LED Display🌀 Cordless stick vacuum provides different suction powers to meet all cleaning needs. With the MAX 26500 Pa powerful suction power to instantly suck up cat litter, dog food crumbs, pet hair and floor dirt, you can spend less time cleaning, perfect for families with pets. You can adjust the floor vacuum power and know the status (such as battery level, suction performance and fault alert) of your foldable vacuum cleaner through touching the LED control panel 🌀 Air Purification Dual HEPA Filtration🌀 Dual HEPA 5 Stages Filtration System: Airtight filtration system captures 100% fine particles (size > 0.1 μm) and 99.97% of ultra-fine particles (size < 0.1 μm), and expels purified clean air. The vacuum cleaner stick is safe and friendly to families with babies, elders, and special-care members 🌀 450W Brushless Motor & LED Light🌀 The ultra-quiet brushless motor (<60db) can produce 26500 pa super suction. The 180° flexible cordless vacuum with LED light can detect the dust in dark areas and easily get in stairs, garage and under furniture. The extended tube is designed for ladies who are hard to reach up high areas like curtains and ceiling. It can be easily converted to a wireless vacuum for sofa and car cleaning 🌀 60 Min Long Running Time🌀 The rechargeable lightweight vacuum provides up to 60 min strong suction, which ensures whole-home deep cleaning conveniently. Redroad cordless vacuum cleaner is suitable for hard floor, tile floor, wooden floor, carpet, rug 🌀 Lightweight & Foldable & Adjustable Vac🌀 2 years quality and technical support. It is easy to converts to a portable foldable vacuum for use anywhere. Redroad carpet vacuum includes LED floor brush, pet brush, crevice nozzle, 2-in-1 dusting brush, soft brush, storage & charge station for versatile cleaning. The lightweight wall-mounted cordless compact vacuum cleaner not only makes cleaning easy, but also keeps your home organized. It is an excellent gift for your family or friends","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G7bG88gmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Redroad","source_asin":"B0BTBWKBBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTBWKBBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTBWKBBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":617270,"name":"Gold Double Curtain Rods for Windows 72 to 144 Inch(6-12Ft),Adjustable Telescoping Double Curtain Rod with Metal End Cap,1 Inch Diameter Heavy Duty Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tkmHi4M8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Iron 🌲Double Curtain Rods for Windows 72 to 144 Inch(6-12Ft):TANGWIN heavy duty double curtain rods include 1 set of front rod(1x50\"x1\"fixed rod,1x50\"x 7/8\"adjustable rod),1 set of back rod(1x 50\"x 5/8\"fixed rod,1 x 50\"x 1/2\"adjustable rod),2 x large finial,2 x small finial,3 x bracket,6 x anchor,6 x screw.Gold adjustable double curtain rods can extend from 72 to 144 inches,choose the right size curtain rods according to the length of your window. 🌲Sturdy & Durable Double Curtain Rods: TANGWIN telescoping double curtain rods have 1 inch diameter front curtain rod and 5/8-inch back curtain rod,each rod is made of iron and iron brackets and sturdy screws, High quality double curtain rods are treated with a proven high temperature curing coating process,smooth surface,beautiful and durable.Heavy duty double curtain rods can stand up to 30 pounds without sinking,support light to heavy curtains, can do double blackout effect. 🌲More Application Scenarios for Double Curtain Rods:TANGWIN decorative double drapery rods are suitable for any room in your home and match a variety of house styles and window treatments,including bedroom, living room, dining room, family room or kitchen.Perfect for creating a layered look,it not only provides visual balance,but also adds a modern touch to your home decoration,enhancing the beauty and artistry of the room. 🌲Modern Design Double Curtain Rods: TANGWIN double curtain rod is styled in a modern design style with smooth lines and beautiful shapes, end caps feature a cylindrical design,highlighting the combination of strength and weight,stylish without losing sturdiness and durability. 🌲Easy to Install Double Curtain Rods:TANGWIN provide detailed illustrated size instructions and modern decorative double drapery rods shipping package have detailed installation instructions inside,follow the steps,gold double curtain rods can easily complete the installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tkmHi4M8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TANGWIN","source_asin":"B0BLP99R4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLP99R4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLP99R4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
