window.products.push({"id":617346,"name":"XL Coasters Harlequin Rosette (6 Inch, Set of 2) – Oversized cork absorbent drink coasters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDIhRSegL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA-LARGE: Say goodbye to dinky 4-inch coasters! Pitchers, stadium cups, beer steins, even multiple beverages – it all fits on our 6-inch, 1/2\" thick, XL Coasters. (Also makes a great trivet.) HIGH-PERFORMANCE: XL Coasters will never stick to the bottom of your drink, and the extra-thick cork sucks up condensation like a rented camel, so your glass will never drip on you either. We also put lots of rubber bumper pads on the bottom to protect your furniture and keep the coasters in place. DURABLE: Cork flooring, like that found in the US Library of Congress, the New York City Public Library and numerous other public spaces, has been in place for 100+ years. SUSTAINABLE & RENEWABLE: Cork is a natural, eco-friendly material derived from the bark of the cork oak tree. Harvesting cork does not harm the trees; only the bark is removed, and it regrows. CARE & CLEANING: Use lukewarm water and a soft cloth or toothbrush to gently wipe surface of cork. Blot off excess water and air dry. PRINTED AND PACKAGED IN AMERICA: We could not locate any US-made cork (it’s harvested from the Iberian Peninsula and the Mediterranean basin of Europe), but all other materials used in the design and manufacture of our XL Coasters are made in the USA. NOTE: Because cork is a natural product and our manufacturing process includes hand-finishing, there may be slight variations from the photographs shown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDIhRSegL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XL Coasters","source_asin":"B00K5QZLP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K5QZLP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K5QZLP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":617347,"name":"Sense Of Art | Kitchen Sign | Framed Wall Art | Kitchen Wall Decor | Dining Room Decor | Kitchen Sign | Dining Room Art Wall Decor | Wall Art Dining R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UPn4wBdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ Premium Quality Material: Made in the USA. This Dining room wall art is crafted by skillful artisans from highest quality materials, a combination of wooden frame and canvas which is guaranteed to withstand the test of time. ❤ Heartfelt Message: “Memories are made around the table\", word to live by which will inspire your family and friends. The Sense of Art dining room art wall decor gathers everyone around with a heartfelt message! ❤ Superb Design: This Memories are made around the table wall decor features a stunning farmhouse design which is easy to mix and match with any home style. Easily hang it in your bedroom, dining room area ,living room, kitchen or even office and add a rustic, cozy finish to your ambiance! ❤ A Thoughtful Present: Order this lovely dining room sign for yourself or as a thoughtful housewarming present for a friend or loved one, and you can be sure to win their appreciation! An excellent idea also for wedding or engagement registry, anniversaries, holidays and more! ❤ Design made by a local artist who has a passion for art and faith","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UPn4wBdOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sense Of Art","source_asin":"B088W7Q334","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088W7Q334","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088W7Q334","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":617348,"name":"Santos Stovetop Vacuum Coffeemaker, 1.0 l, 34 oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hkNOD1pZL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you ever thought watching the coffee brew was on a par with watching the paint dry, think again! This innovative and visually stunning brewing method is sure to attract an audience, there as much for the show as they are for a cup of joe. Water is heated in the lower jug on the stovetop or a spirit burner and eventually boils up through a funnel where it mixes with the ground coffee, once the coffee is brewed, the unit is removed from the heat and brewed coffee is released back into the lower jug. Equal parts chemistry, theatre, engineering and sculpture, this coffeemaker from Bodum is made for the spotlight. Made from temperature safe/heat resistant borosilicate glass, brewing in the vacuum coffeemaker is even easier than it looks: just add water, set the upper globe in place, add coffee and turn on the stove. After the coffee has brewed, take it off the heat and the vacuum will kick in to suck down and separate all of the brewed coffee from the grounds. Because you are using water that is close to 198 degrees Fahrenheit you get the maximum flavor extraction with no paper filters to soak up the essential oils. The experts agree, this is one of the best ways to brew coffee. The capacity is 1.0 liter or 34 oz. Dishwasher safe. Measures 9-1/4 by 6 by 11-1/2 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hkNOD1pZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B000K6JPS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000K6JPS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000K6JPS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
