window.products.push({"id":617521,"name":"{Angled Tips} Reusable Straws with Case & Silicone Tips, Ideal for Travel Straw, Smoothies and Soft Drinks Reusable, with Cleaning Brush, 9\" Eco Frien","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aqtvik+kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"An excellent eco friendly gift for anyone, ever yourself. Can be used for both hot and cold drinks, smoothie, coffee, water...almost any liquid! Enjoy every sip! Unlike metal / stainless steel straws, glass straws can be used for hot drinks and don't leave an aftertaste. SET INCLUDES: - 2 larger transparent glass straws that can be used for thicker drinks like smoothies - 2 normal sized transparent glass straws for drinks like coffee, soda, water - 2 brushes made out of natural hair, one for each size of straw - 4 green silicone tips, two for each size of straw - 1 cotton straw case for carrying the straws and brushes SIZE: - Straws are 9” long (23 cm) and the outer diameter is 0.47” for the wide straws and 0.39” for the normal sized straws (12 mm and 10 mm) - The straws fit most tumblers (Yeti, Ozark, RTIC...) - Brushes are 9” long (23 cm) - Bag is 9.8” long (25 cm) and 5.2\" (13 cm) wide when open  - Tips are 2” long (5 cm) MATERIAL: - Straws are made of borosilicate glass, which is more shock- and temperature resistant than normal glass - Brush hairs are made from high quality natural bristles - The bag is made from cotton - The tips are made of silicone - MACHINE WASHABLE – both the straws, brushes and tips can be washed in a dishwasher and the bag can be washed in a washing machine INSTRUCTIONS: - We recommend washing the straws and tips before first use - For easier application of tips, make the straw top wet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aqtvik+kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LunaArce","source_asin":"B07ZHKTWZJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZHKTWZJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZHKTWZJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
