window.products.push({"id":617581,"name":"Rada Cutlery 4-Piece Utility Knife Set Stainless Steel Steak Knives with Brushed Aluminum Made in USA, 8-5/8 Inches, Silver Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v2TGMHDTL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The Rada Cutlery S55 4-Piece Utility Steak Knife Set is a gorgeous set of steak knives that can be given as a gift for almost any occasion. Anyone that enjoys cooking or hosting dinner parties will be thrilled to receive this knife set as a gift. Meat lovers will love these knives, as they are ideal for cutting a thick, juicy steak, as well as other meats such as a delicious pork chop or succulent chicken. Each steak knife boasts a non-serrated 4-7/8 inch blade and has an overall length of 8-5/8 inches. The long blade on these steak knives allows you to use them at the dinner table or as a utility knife in the kitchen. The blades are made from surgical quality, T420 high carbon stainless steel and are hand sharpened creating a razor sharp edge. The hollow ground blades ensure a precision concave surface for maximum edge retention. The handles on these steak knives are made from permanently cast silver brushed aluminum with a satin finish. These dinner knives should not be washed in the dishwasher. Handwashing is recommended. The set comes beautifully boxed with a form-fitted insert holding each knife securely in place. Rada Mfg. Co. is located in Waverly, Iowa and has been manufacturing cutlery in the USA since 1948. Our mission is all about “providing our customers the best value of kitchen knives for their dollar.” We stand by our craftsmanship. Rada Mfg. Co. will replace any product manufactured by our company returned to us due to defects in material or workmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v2TGMHDTL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RADA","source_asin":"B0796551NM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0796551NM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0796551NM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":617582,"name":"6-IN-1 Adjustable Cervical Neck Pillows for Pain Relief Sleeping, Memory Foam Bolster Pillows with Detachable Pad, Neck Support Pillow for Body Lumbar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R7+dYGTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【FROM NOW, ELIMINATE NECK PAIN WITH ZERO EFFORT!】Fed up with neck pain? Just lay down on Demelon neck pillow to bring you relief! Designed to cradle your head & stretch your neck, our contour pillow features a sloped neck ramp for the lowest part of your C-spine, an arched cushion to relieve upper neck pressure, and a concave head basin for natural alignment. The built-in step massage spot targets pain points & stimulates neck muscles, providing ultimate comfort and relief throughout your neck. 【FOR NECK LUMBAR KNEE LEG BACK, ONE-STOP SOLUTION FOR ALL YOUR NEEDS!】Designed to be your go-to solution for any situation, this roll pillow seamlessly transforms to fit any need you may have. Whether looking for a supportive headrest on a long journey, a cozy body pillow for alleviating neck pain, a cushioned bolster for your reading or work, or even a knee pillow to reduce swelling&improve circulation, Demelon has you covered. Get ultimate comfort and support with Demelon cervical neck pillow! 【PERSONALIZE YOUR SLEEP WITH DETACHABLE PADS!】One size doesn't fit all, so we designed the Demelon adjustable bed pillow to offer a one-of-a-kind personalized sleep experience. We added an extra detachable layer to help you find the proper height for your head&neck. With two sides and multiple combination ways, you can achieve both varying heights and slopes to provide the most ergonomic and comfortable support for your spine and neck. Free combination, Bring you a tailor-made comfit experience! 【RENEWABLE BIODEGRADABLE FOAM, BETTER ORGANIC SLEEP】 We believe in a circular economy that accounts for the lifecycle of our products. That's one reason we design our neck pain pillow entirely from plant-based memory foam which is CertiPUR-US certified, it's a renewable&biodegradable foam with no smell for guilt-free relaxation. The cover of the round pillow is machine-washable. Choose our eco-friendly orthopedic pillow and take the first step towards a healthier and more sustainable lifestyle! 【RISK & HASSLE-FREE CUSTOMER SERVICE】Surprise your loved ones with the gift of a better sleep experience - our neck support pillows for sleeping are a perfect choice! Enjoy a 100-night trial and 3-year warranty with our memory foam pillows, ensuring a hassle-free return or replacement if needed, for a risk-free purchase. NOTICE: Normally you will need 1-2 weeks to adapt to this neck pillow for pain relief sleeping because it needs time to fit your neck contour, but the result is worth the wait!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R7+dYGTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Demelon","source_asin":"B0C65KL44K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65KL44K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65KL44K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":617583,"name":"3M Brown Stripper Pad 7100, 20 in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Rv4CNvmHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description For wet or dry stripping. Prepares floors for recoating. Quickly and easily cuts through old finish. Conforms to uneven floors. From the Manufacturer Both aggressive and very conformable, 3M™ Brown Stripper Pad 7100 can be used in wet stripping, dry-foam stripping, and deep scrubbing processes, performing well even on bumpy, irregular, or worn floors. When used in a heavy-duty scrubbing process, the 3M™ Brown Stripping Pad 7100 will remove up to 2-4 coats of finish in preparation for refinishing. With appropriate cleaning chemicals, it can be used to clean heavily soiled hard-surface floors such as concrete. The pad is uniformly permeated throughout its open construction with resin and mineral abrasives, providing impressive performance and a long, useful life. 3M™ Brown Stripper Pad 7100 is constructed of continuous filament nylon in an open-textured non-woven web. Abrasive particles are disbursed throughout and bonded to the non-woven construction with a durable adhesive. The pads are used with water-based floor finish stripping solutions for both dry-foam stripping and deep scrubbing. Floor stripping pads are designed to remove finish, sealer, and contaminants from floor surfaces prior to refinishing. Stripping is done at the start of a maintenance program and at times when scrubbing will not achieve the desired results. For more than a century, 3M has applied innovation and technology to improving our customers’ lives and supporting their business goals. Today the company, from its headquarters in St. Paul, Minnesota, serves industrial and commercial customers and consumers in nearly 200 countries. Building and Commercial Services products—a diverse category including environmental monitors, floor mats, fire barriers, and cleaning solutions—help customers maintain clean, safe, and attractive facilities. The 3M brand, across thousands of products, represents consistency, superior quality, and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Rv4CNvmHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3M","source_asin":"B006LW2ZBI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006LW2ZBI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006LW2ZBI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
