window.products.push({"id":617685,"name":"38'' Stuffed Animals Bean Bag Extra Large Chair Cover -100% Cotton Canvas Kids Toy Storage Zipper Bags Organizer Comfy Pouf for Boys Girls Toddlar, Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbj0QYXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tired and sick of facing clutter when entering kid’s bedroom, playroom or living room?Want to make and enjoy time together with your kids?No more worries, here it comes! What you need is a stuffed animal toys storage organizer bean bag chair! Tidiness and comfortable seating all-in-one, functional and decorative for household, this bean bag chair comes in 2 sizes and 6 colors! You deserve it! Features: 1. Made of strong and soft cotton canvas fabric, machine washable, without any color fading. 2. Handle design on the top, easy for lifting and moving around. 3. Double stitch, more durable, do not worry about tearing. 4. Double zipper, you can pull in any direction you want. 5. Small Size - 24\" in diameter, 78.7\" in perimeter, can hold 60 stuffed animal toys; Standard Size - 38\" in diameter, 118\" in perimeter, can hold 100 stuffed animal toys. 6. 6 colors available: unisex for girls and boys - grey & white stripes, pink & white stripes, blue & white wave stripes, grey with flowers, blue with fishes, grey with outer space. Multi-Function: 1. A functional storage bean bag for stuffed animals. Besides, a organizer cover for your extra throw pillows, blankets, dress up costumes, and seasonal clothes.2. A perfect addition to playroom decor, attractive and funny.3. Can be used as a seating lounger, ideal for reading and relaxing.4. This novelty will motivate children establish a concept of \"Do by myself\" from sorting and nattiness, help them develop a sense of self-reliance and responsibility.5. Make happy parent-baby hours, turn off the TV and phone, enjoy creative, active play time together! Notice: 1. Please allow 1\" error due to manual measurement.2. Products may be slightly different in color varies different production batches.3. Product color may be slightly different from picture varies light and screen difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbj0QYXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Injoy","source_asin":"B07HFG6QF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HFG6QF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HFG6QF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
