window.products.push({"id":617694,"name":"Mortar and Pestle Set,6 Inch 2 Cups 100% Unpolished Granite Mortar and Pestle Large-Easy to Clean&No Pieces of Shedding,for Crushing/Grinding-Guacamol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QqOdwjaML._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿Guaranteed high-quality natural granite, strong and durable to lead a healthy and eco-friendly life: The mortar and pestle set is made of 100% unpolished natural granite, hand-build from a whole granite stone, the texture is hard and no dust will fall into food when grinding,resists scratches and stains,sturdy non-slip, acid alkali and corrosion resistant, durable,natural and non-porous to ensure no residual taste or odor, food-grade granite kitchen essential, a good helper for healthy life 🌿Easy to use, Easy to clean: Granite mortar and pestle just the right weight helps it stay firmly in place without slipping,with non-slip pads,heavy bowl weighted pestle and strong friction from the unpolished inner wall makes mashing easy and simple,Comfortable grip, foolproof grip,fluted bowl bottom for easy access,frosted deep groove design makes it difficult for ingredients to jump out,can quickly crush, grind or powder raw materials, non-porous surface makes cleaning easy,Just wash and dry 🌿Wide application of granite mortar and pestle set：Mortar and pestle large is an all-purpose masher that easily grinds many ingredients, even the toughest spices, such as nuts, seeds, ginger, peppercorns, spices and garlic to powder, homemade salad dressing, various A variety of sauces and condiments, such as fresh mustard, salsa, guacamole, quark hot sauce, pesto, chutney etc., stone mortar and pestle can be widely used to grind pills into powder to help people or pets take medicine quickly 🌿Manually grind, Original flavor: molcajete mexicano bowl has been used as a way to crush, grind, and powder herbs and dry spices. As opposed to an electric grinder or shredder, the ancient, durable, traditional hand-grinding method ensures that all cooking ingredients get the most out of their flavors and aromas, evoking the natural and original flavors of your food, producing the best, tastiest paste to make food closer to nature, to get the best kitchen experience and cooking taste 🍀PERFECT GIFT & SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: A mortar and pestle is the perfect gift for anyone who loves to cook. mortar and pestle with grip perfect for a holiday, housewarming or birthday gift. We hope you are absolutely satisfied with the mortar and pestle pharmacy , if granite mortar and pestle set large is damaged or otherwise, please contact me in time, I will give you a satisfactory solution, we provide a 36-month warranty, welcome to order the mortar pestle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QqOdwjaML._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luvan","source_asin":"B0BJZV7V12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJZV7V12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJZV7V12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
