window.products.push({"id":617714,"name":"Mind Reader 50 Nespresso capsules or 24 Vertuoline capsules Coffee Pod Storage Drawer Organizer, White Plastic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r2X8Go6TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The MIND READER Single Drawer Coffee Pod Holder saves you time, space, and stress! Getting up in the morning to make coffee shouldn’t feel like a frantic scavenger hunt to find what you need. Keep your kitchen drawers and cabinets closed, skip the scrambling, and get out the door on time with your coffee in hand. Have all 50 single serve coffee pods in a simple neatly organized and easy to pull drawer. Organize all of your favorite coffee pods using this convenient storage solution. For any moment in the day where coffee is in order, simply find what you're looking for. And don't let spills or stains stop you! Just cause coffee stations can get a little dirty, this organizer is easily cleaned in just a few wipes. The top surface and inside drawer can have mess effortlessly washed away with a single cloth or paper towel. Simply pull the drawer out and clean away! We've also designed this pod holder with minimalism and simplicity in mind. Place the MIND READER Single Drawer Coffee Pod Holder under any pod coffee maker and have it instantly blend into any type of decor with minimalism and style. It adds a clean yet luxurious touch to your office or kitchen space. And we know that quality coffee deserves quality storage. So never again do you have to place your expensive finely brewed coffee inside the grip of a sticky, flimsy, poorly constructed pod holders, carousels or racks. Let this durable coffee storage drawer (made with attention to detail and superior materials) reflect your tastes. Join the coffee lovers around the world who rely on the MIND READER Single Drawer Coffee Pod Holder to keep their coffee pods organized and accessible. It's a simple, reliable, and affordable coffee pod storage solution that's just a click away. Buy it now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r2X8Go6TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B09JQFV7GL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JQFV7GL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JQFV7GL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
