window.products.push({"id":617718,"name":"Electric Air Pump,Portable Quick-Fill Air Pump with 3 Nozzles,110-240V AC/12V DC,Powerful and Safe Inflator for Air Bed,Mattress,Boat, Pool, Float, Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fsBYjTS-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Two Way Electric Pump: electric air pump for inflatables/deflatables,quickly inflates & deflates all,To inflate,put the nozzles at the side output port, to deflate,put the nozzle at the vent port on top of the pump.Makes inflatables & deflatables easy and efficient,save more time for fun With 3 Nozzles: Rechargeable air pump with 3 nozzle sizes,S,M and L for you to choose,suitable for more inflatable/deflatable products,air pump for pool inflatables,High-power air pump for air mattresses,boats,airbeds,rafts,swimming rings and inflatable toys,Large volume inflateables Home Car Dual Purpose Air Pump: Electric Air pump with Home power adapter (110-240V) and Car power adapter (AC/12V DC) two adapters,so you can use it wherever you need it,at home,or while on the go during travel,indoor and outdoor Fast Inflation/Deflation: This pool float pump is over 25 times faster than manual air pumps.Inflating and deflating quick and easy without manually pumping,The ordinary air mattresses,swimming ring,inflatable toys can be filled within few seconds Portable & Multi-Purpose: The inflatable mattress pump is small and lightweight,you can easily take air pumps anywhere you go,especially for travel and outdoor activities,Saving time on inflating air Mattress,air beds,air boats,inflatable sofa,air-filled toys,inflatable pool,inflatable furniture,swimming ring and more ( NOTE: DO NOT use it for inflating high pressure products, like tires, basketball and balloons!!!!!! )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fsBYjTS-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUEAST","source_asin":"B096P2L64C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096P2L64C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096P2L64C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":617719,"name":"Yair Emanuel Fruit Bowl Serving Salad Centerpiece Large Bowl Laser Cut Hand Painting Hearts (Bundle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WfYoHR7gL._AC_.jpg","description":"ARBEL JUDAICA is are proud to present a personal work of art by Yair Emanuel Large Bowl Laser Cut Hand Painting Birds The Artist, Yair Emanuel designs and crafts in many different techniques. Among his techniques you could find Hand embroidery, painting on wood & glass, painting on silk and variety of metal designs. Vivid and harmonious colors as well as a mixture of the old and the new, characterize Emanuel's work. This Lovely Bowl is Multicolored with beautiful Birds Decor This Creation will add beauty, light, happiness and blessings on your house and business doors. Also, will make an amazing ornament and will be a welcome addition to your home or perfect gift for any occasion. Sizes: 25X25X5 cms 14x14x2.5 \" Artist Yair Emanuel, a graduate of the Bezalel Academy of Art and Design, lives and works in Jerusalem. Emanuel's style of Judaic art is based upon a fusion of traditional motifs and ancient Jewish manuscripts with modern and Oriental art. Vivid and harmonious colors as well as a mixture of the old and the new characterize Emanuel's work, which is designed and crafted in his Jerusalem studio. ARBEL JUDAICA is an Authorized Reseller of the artist Yair Emanuel, please don't hesitate contacts us in order to make a large scaled order for event or parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WfYoHR7gL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yair Emanuel","source_asin":"B00ZCFM6CI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZCFM6CI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZCFM6CI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
