window.products.push({"id":617868,"name":"C.R. Gibson Farm Stand Magnetic Shopping List Pad, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-rkmGAyQL._AC_SL1393_.jpg","description":"Inspire organization with coordinating recipe cards, pocket organizers and recipe card file boxes in the Farm Stand collection. The magnetic shopping list pad is a convenient, quick way to add to your grocery list or jot cooking notes right when you think of them. Pad has 75 lined sheets and a large 3-inch x 1.75-inch magnetic strip on the back for keeping it secure in the kitchen. The entire pad measures 4.5-Inch wide x 9.25-Inch tall. Makes a great stocking stuffer or addition to a gift basket for a wedding, birthday, Mother's Day or raffle ticket fundraiser. Nothing says home quite like the kitchen. See recipe books, flip stands, recipe cards, cookbook page flags, shopping list pads, freezer labels and gift tags in this theme. Brought to you by C.R. Gibson, who is 140 plus years young. Founded in 1870 in New York City by lithographer John Gibson, the focus then was on letterhead, stationery and marriage certificates. After beginning production of baby books in 1898, millions have been sold. 1 in every 4 babies today has a memory book made by C.R. Gibson. In the 1960s, the company expanded into the gift book and photo album market and now continues to progress through the digital technology age as the number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. C.R. Gibson has since made artistic alliances and partnerships with some of the most unique and trusted brands to bring consumers a wide choice of not only high-quality paper products, but party and entertaining supplies with panache, along with kitchen, wedding and everyday gift items, all of which combine the most current trends, the best artists in the market and superior quality. Inspiring, fun and thoughtful products that you would be proud to give and excited to receive. That's just the first 140 years and so much more is still to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-rkmGAyQL._AC_SL1393_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B00SXYVUHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-617868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SXYVUHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SXYVUHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
